    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d46">

                <pb facs="0770" n="620" xml:id="pg620"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 3691/49.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President Roosevelt to the President of
                    Honduras.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-02-14"><hi rendition="#italic">February 14,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I thank you for your kind answer to my dispatch of February 11, and I beg you to
                    believe that I highly appreciate the admirable spirit in which you have received
                    and answered the suggestions in the interest of peace. I shall be glad to render
                    any assistance in my power toward working out a practical solution of the
                    interesting problem in accordance with the ideas in which we so perfectly
                    agree.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Theodore
                    Roosevelt.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
